# --- Secrets: never commit (repo pushes to GitHub) ---
SzymonWebApp/*
!SzymonWebApp/README.md

# --- Large / synced data (per CLAUDE.md: OneDrive) ---
Experimental_Data/
!Experimental_Data/.gitkeep

# --- ToProcessWClaude/ was dismantled 2026-07-21 into Experimental_Data/ ---
# Raw exports now live under Experimental_Data/Cycling/ and TGA_DSC/ (ignored above).
# Kept as a guard in case the staging folder is ever recreated by a transfer.
ToProcessWClaude/
!ToProcessWClaude/*.md

# --- Literature PDFs (per CLAUDE.md) ---
Literature_Review/**/*.pdf

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__MACOSX/
*.tmp

# --- Analysis pipeline: scripts AND their JSON output ARE tracked (228 KB total) ---
# so Figures/ can be regenerated without the gitignored 553 MB of raw instrument data.
# Python cruft only:
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- LaTeX build artifacts (Formal_Docs/) ---
# .tex sources ARE tracked; the compiled PDF and latexmk cruft are not.
# Rebuild: see Formal_Docs/Preliminary_Presentation/README.md
Formal_Docs/**/*.pdf
Formal_Docs/**/*.aux
Formal_Docs/**/*.log
Formal_Docs/**/*.nav
Formal_Docs/**/*.out
Formal_Docs/**/*.snm
Formal_Docs/**/*.toc
Formal_Docs/**/*.fls
Formal_Docs/**/*.fdb_latexmk
Formal_Docs/**/*.synctex.gz
